# Both are optional. Leave both blank and the app runs entirely in
# Demo Mode — pre-written AI analysis, zero API calls, zero cost.
#
# To enable Live Mode, get a free-tier key from ONE of these:
#   Groq    -> https://console.groq.com/keys      (fast, generous free tier)
#   Gemini  -> https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (free tier, no card required)
#
# The server checks GROQ_API_KEY first, then GEMINI_API_KEY.
# If a live call fails for any reason (missing key, rate limit, network),
# the API route falls back to the same demo content automatically —
# the UI never shows a raw error.

GROQ_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
